{"title": "Repulsion Mine", "pageid": 47952, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Repulsion_Mine", "categories": ["Immune to all Slashing", "Resistant to Non-Magical Piercing", "Immune to all Acid", "Immune to all Necrotic", "Immune to all Fire", "Immune to all Lightning", "Immune to all Cold", "Immune to all Psychic", "Immune to all Poison", "Immune to all Radiant", "Vulnerable to Force", "Environmental objects", "Traps"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/1/16/RepulsionMine.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"RepulsionMine.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/RepulsionMine.png/300px-RepulsionMine.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/RepulsionMine.png/300px-RepulsionMine.png.webp 1x, /w/images/1/16/RepulsionMine.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"RepulsionMine.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2